  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find bounding box of 5s\n    min_r = min(r for r in range(rows) for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 5)\n    max_r = max(r for r in range(rows) for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 5)\n    min_c = min(c for r in range(rows) for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 5)\n    max_c = max(c for r in range(rows) for c in range(cols) if grid[r][c] == 5)\n    \n    h = max_r - min_r + 1\n    w = max_c - min_c + 1\n    bh = h // 3\n    bw = w // 3\n    \n    # Extract 3x3 pattern\n    pattern = [[0]*3 for _ in range(3)]\n    for bi in range(3):\n        for bj in range(3):\n            r = min_r + bi * bh\n            c = min_c + bj * bw\n            pattern[bi][bj] = 1 if grid[r][c] == 5 else 0\n    \n    # Fractal substitution\n    out = [[0]*9 for _ in range(9)]\n    for i in range(9):\n        for j in range(9):\n            if pattern[i // 3][j // 3] and pattern[i % 3][j % 3]:\n                out[i][j] = 5\n    return out",
